輶"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"請為山陰令復有殊績遷衞軍參軍本國郎中令加寧"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"朔將軍桓𤣥輔晉以為大將軍録事參軍時三吳饑荒"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"遣鎮之銜命賑卹而會稽內史王愉不奉符旨鎮之依"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":5,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"事糺奏愉子綏𤣥之外甥當時貴盛鎮之為所排抑以"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":6,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"母老求補安成太守及𤣥敗𤣥將苻宏寇亂郡境鎮之"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":7,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"拒戰彌年子弟五人並臨陣見殺母憂去職在官清潔"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":8,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"妻子無以自給乃棄家致喪還上虞舊基畢為子標之"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"求安復令隨子之官服闋為征西道規司馬南平太守"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"右","leaf":"二下","column_from_right":10,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"徐道覆逼江陵加鎮之建威將軍統檀道濟到彦之等"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"左","leaf":"三上","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"討道覆以不經將帥固辭不見聽旣而前軍失利白衣"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"左","leaf":"三上","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"領職尋復本官以討道覆功封華容縣五等男徵廷尉"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"左","leaf":"三上","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"晉穆帝何皇后山陵領將作大匠遷御史中丞秉正不"},{"pdf_page":92,"half":"左","leaf":"三上","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":5,"text":"撓百寮憚之"}]},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi-wyd","book_id":"b-songshu-092","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi-wyd"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014","text":"鎮之初為琅邪王衞軍行參軍，出補剡、上虞令，並有能名。內史謝輶請為山陰令，復有殊績。遷衞軍參軍，本國郎中令，加寧朔將軍。桓玄輔晉，以為大將軍錄事參軍。時三吳飢荒，遣鎮之銜命賑卹，而會稽內史王愉不奉符旨，鎮之依事糾奏。愉子綏，玄之外甥，當時貴盛，鎮之為所排抑，以母老求補安成太守。及玄敗，玄將苻宏寇亂郡境，鎮之拒戰彌年，子弟五人，並臨陣見殺。母憂去職，在官清潔，妻子無以自給，乃棄家致喪還上虞舊墓。葬畢，為子標之求安復令，隨子之官。服闋，為征西道規司馬、南平太守。徐道覆逼江陵，加鎮之建威將軍，統檀道濟、到彥之等討道覆，以不經將帥，固辭，不見聽。既而前軍失利，白衣領職，尋復本官。以討道覆功，封華容縣五等男，徵廷尉。晉穆帝何皇后山陵，領將作大匠。遷御史中丞，秉正不撓，百僚憚之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"琅邪王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"待核首次府主身份"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"謝輶","kind":"person","person_id":"ao0_c0z_ryc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"桓玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"王愉","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"愉","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"綏","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8m